cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite release v1.2.0, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22855972, for these reporting and reproducibility corrections. The manuscript is under revision for Clinica Chimica Acta."
title: "ISO 15189 LLM Config Experiment: Dataset and Analysis Code"
abstract: >-
  Dataset, analysis code, manuscript variants, and reproducibility materials
  for a study on LLM-assisted ISO 15189:2022 medical laboratory quality
  management system (QMS) document generation. Includes 486 generated QMS
  documents: 405 Claude Opus 4.6 documents across 9 configurations, 15 tasks,
  and 3 repetitions; 81 GPT-5.4 documents across the same configurations,
  tasks A1/B1/C1, and 3 repetitions. Contains 759 archived document-level
  LLM-judge records (486 GPT and 273 Claude) and 30 expert rating forms
  from 3 same-institution coauthor raters on 10 Claude-generated Class A
  documents. Additional historical Claude means survive only in aggregate.
  Release v1.2.0 contains author-approved reporting and reproducibility corrections.
